&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://thoughtbot.com/blog/sign-in-with-google-for-react-native" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;React Native Social Auth - Sign in with Google for Android, iOS, Expo&lt;/a&gt;
