&lt;p&gt;Since sharing this opportunity with the community, &lt;strong&gt;Francis&lt;/strong&gt; has also published a dedicated DEV post about the &lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Developer&lt;/strong&gt; volunteer role at CALEC. If that role interests you, it's worth checking out for his perspective and some additional information about what the team is looking for.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/devengers/want-to-volunteer-with-me-as-a-full-stack-developer-join-me-at-calec-2hne"&gt;Francis' post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

