&lt;li&gt;Next.js — &lt;a href="https://nextjs.org/docs/app/getting-started/linking-and-navigating" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Linking and navigating&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Next.js — &lt;a href="https://nextjs.org/docs/app/getting-started/caching" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Caching&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Next.js — &lt;a href="https://github.com/vercel/next.js/discussions/95130" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;16.3 Preview feedback discussion&lt;/a&gt;
